      "raw": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-Hant\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>404 找不到頁面 - 鯤鵬數據</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"你訪問的頁面不存在，可返回 鯤鵬數據 首頁繼續查看金融數據 API、產品清單、開發文檔與全球股市節假日頁面。\" />\n  <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,follow\" />\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0a0f1a\" />\n  <style>\n    :root { --primary:#10b981; --dk:#0a0f1a; --text:#e5edf8; --sub:rgba(255,255,255,.55); }\n    * { box-sizing:border-box; }\n    body { margin:0; min-height:100vh; font-family:\"PingFang TC\",\"Noto Sans TC\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif; background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(16,185,129,.12), transparent 35%), linear-gradient(180deg, #08111f 0%, #0a0f1a 100%); color:var(--text); display:grid; place-items:center; padding:24px; }\n    .card { width:min(760px,100%); background:rgba(255,255,255,.04); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:28px; box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.24); padding:40px; text-align:center; }\n    .badge { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:8px 16px; border-radius:999px; background:rgba(16,185,129,.12); color:#86efac; border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,.18); font-size:12px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:18px; }\n    h1 { margin:0 0 14px; font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,58px); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.04em; }\n    p { margin:0 auto 26px; max-width:560px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.85; color:var(--sub); }\n    .actions { display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }\n    .btn { height:46px; padding:0 22px; border-radius:12px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:14px; font-weight:800; text-decoration:none; transition:.2s; }\n    .btn-primary { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#18b57b,#109969); color:#fff; box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(16,163,109,.22); }\n    .btn-primary:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:0 18px 36px rgba(16,163,109,.28); }\n    .btn-secondary { background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); color:#e5edf8; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); }\n    .btn-secondary:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">404 Not Found</div>\n    <h1>這個頁面不存在</h1>\n    <p>你訪問的地址可能已經變更，或者輸入有誤。可以返回首頁繼續查看 鯤鵬數據 的行情 API、產品清單、開發文檔與股市節假日頁面。</p>\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/\">返回首頁</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/docs.html\">查看開發文件</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/stocks.html\">產品清單</a>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
